[Quotes]
victory0 = "Do not worry... Soon you will become part of the planets energy... and then part of me."
victory1 = "I shall deliver you to the promised land."
victory2 = "On your knees. I want you to beg for forgiveness."
victory3 = "I will... NEVER be a memory."
victory4 = "Give into the dark."
victory5 = "I am the chosen one!"
victory6 = "I've thought of a great idea... Let's go to the promised land."
victory7 = "Tell me what you cherish most... Give me the pleasure of taking it away."
victory8 = "I am becoming one with the planet."
victory9 = "Mother... It's almost time."
victory10 = "So cold... I'm always by your side..."
;Cloud by Infinite
victory11 = "How do you think you could save yourself if you couldn't even save them?"
victory12 = "Fear not... You will soon be with the rest of your pathetic village."
;Aeris by The Great Matsutzu
victory13 = "Foolish girl... I have become a being far surpassing the Cetra..."
victory14 = "Say hello to Zack for me."
;Tifa Lockhart by Shin Mako
victory15 = "Just as weak as your father was."
victory16 = "Do not be afraid. Both you and Cloud will become part of me."
;Ryu by chuchoryu
victory17 = "It seems you have no knowledge of the Promised Land. Allow me to take you there."
victory18 = "Have I given you the challenge you seek?"
;Ken by chuchoryu
victory19 = "Your fists will not be enough Mr. Masters."
victory20 = "This is the best you have to offer? You sicken me. Perhaps you don't even deserve to become part of me."
;Gouken by Ghost Killer
victory21 = "Do not despair... Soon your students will join with the planet's energy too."
victory22 = "You are formidable. But you cannot stand up to a god."
;Akuma by Warusaki3
victory23 = "It seems you have lost the will to even live after defeat... So I shall allow you to grovel as Meteor descends upon the planet.
victory24 = "A demon cannot defeat a god... However, I commend your strength. I will be sure that you get a place in the Promised Land."
;Goku by Team Z2
victory25 = "Your energy.. it's like nothing I've seen before... But now, It's mine."
victory26 = "Mother... are you pleased? I have brought you a wonderful present... It's a Saiyan..."
;Vegeta Z2 by Team Z2
victory27 = "So you are a prince are you...? Well I guess you used to be."
victory28 = "Show me Vegeta... Show me the power of a Super Saiyan! Thew power that will belong to ME!"
;Haomaru by NRF
victory29 = "Your swordsmanship has left me wanting more... Unimpressive, Samurai."
victory30 = "Do not worry, Samurai. You will not feel dishonored for much longer, for soon, you will become a part of me and will feel nothing. Nothing at all."
;Lyndis by Ambasa
victory31 = "Nomadic swordswoman... Perhaps you should come back after refining your pathetic technique."
victory32 = "Foolish of you to face me Sacean trash. You cannot hope to defeat me or my mother."

;▼変数一覧
;1 : キャンセル可否フラグ
;2 : ループ制御
;3 : 被State奪取判定
;4 : 汎用（トリガー制御など）
;5-9 : 汎用
;10 : マテリア 1=こうげき 2=ぼうぎょ 9=マスター
;11 : 投げに使用
;12 : 貫通表示用
;13 : ブラックマテリアレベル 1=コメット 2=コメテオ 3=メテオ
;14 : ブラックマテリア発動までのフレーム数
;15 : 閃光に使用
;16 : 暗転濃度 0で真っ黒（超必時基本64）
;17 : マテリア再使用までのカウント
;18 : 現在のStateNo（アーマー処理用）
;19 : 現在のAnimElemNo（アーマー処理用）
;20 : アーマー処理中
;40 : 先行入力 ステート保持
;41 : 先行入力 残り有効フレーム数
;42 : 前を押しっぱなしにしているフレーム数
;43 : 後ろを押しっぱなしにしているフレーム数
;44 : ジャストガード成立中（残りF数）
;45 : 1=スーパーキャンセル成立 2=ガードキャンセル成立
;46 : ダメージボイス管理
;49 : ヒットエフェクト位置基準Y（0:自分 1:敵）
;50 : ヒットエフェクト種類
;51 : ヒットエフェクト位置X
;52 : ヒットエフェクト位置Y
;53 : ヒットエフェクト上下反転
;54 : ヒットエフェクト前後反転
;55 : AIで使用（汎用）
;56 : AIで使用（行動抑制）
;57 : AIで使用（敵の状態調査）
;58 : AIで使用
;59 : AIスイッチ

;▼変数（Float）一覧
;1  : コンボ補正
;2  : コンボ補正（超必用）
;3  : AI用 P2Dist X（誤差あり）
;4  : AI用 P2Dist Y（誤差あり）
;11 : 汎用（サイズ決定等）
;12 : 汎用（サイズ決定等）
;13-19 : 汎用（AI等で使用）
;20 : ヒットエフェクトサイズX
;21 : ヒットエフェクトサイズY

